From f2b32bc3662c526971fecae367501f35c5df1e0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:43:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] Simulate the Auto for the preview

simulateAuto runs the card tree against a scenario (when each registered
condition turns true), picks decision rows, drives paths on the app's
motion profile and returns the robot timeline in the app's own format,
plus a log and the rows taken. The endgame guard stops whatever is
running once the time left is down to the park path's drive time.
worstCase gives each branch's latest end when every wait runs to its
time row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
